  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Three correctness fixes.\n\n- Deleted content no longer appears in search results. Recycle-bin content was included by default, so a deleted node could rank alongside live ones.\n- Recent items are now checked against the server each time the palette opens: renamed nodes show their current name, deleted ones drop off. If the check cannot reach the server the list is left untouched.\n- Results are named in the language you are working in - the variant of the node you have open, or your chosen backoffice language. Single-language and invariant sites are unaffected.\n\nNothing to configure, and no change to how the palette is used. Includes the changes prepared for 1.0.3, which was never published. Full changelog: https://github.com/BMichal93/Umbraco.Community.CommandPalette/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
